igcaption>妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250930/1049649722316427264217063.jpeg/rJBYiAaKkt2eN0aWd6-Ov0p0MrXY3ZOYeRA3bXkQN20\"/><figcaption>妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250930/1049649722127683584342015.jpeg/ptu0DDGDf65VztLkM5dfTl9Jhi9XqS3QD1PXOQ9T1zk\"/><figcaption>妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250930/1049649722584862720539108.jpeg/_3krznI1-HsoptRbCqWFKSfDTqXGNnmUhgMuY4YDLmM\"/><figcaption>妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250930/1049649722807160832742560.jpeg/i_3lVLESnOwOdB380oqeQZ-scGlTGpXSo4k5y6OJOcs\"/><figcaption>妮歌潔曼在IG分享的照片（IG@nicolekidman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"妮歌潔曼（IG@nicolekidman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250930/1049649436302512128743519.jpeg/V-0t_hbmglh_KBSu6L3Rmpbs9QZ3s16gYRoFx2EaBcc\"/><figcaption>妮歌潔曼（IG@nicolekidman）</figcaption></figure><p>64歲阿湯哥秀腹肌！20年後再登GQ封面　談「死亡」毫無畏懼</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T11:39:55.003801+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2264,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}